---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const title = "电池行业周刊 — 2026年第38周 | 电池计算器";
const description = "本周电池资讯：合同收入是加州BESS融资的关键，esVolta首席执行官解释，伊比利亚BESS市场需要更多灵活性、更清晰的框架和更快的审批，'一个真正困难的问题'：Gridmatic首席商务官谈BESS收入预测挑战，人工智能和负荷共址的作用。";
const canonical = "https://batterycalculators.com/zh/news/battery-industry-weekly-2026-week-38";
const publishDate = "2026-09-22";
const lastUpdated = "2026-09-22";
const readingTime = 24;

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: '资讯', href: '/zh/news' },
  { label: '2026年第38周' },
];
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  ogType="article"
  schema="webApplication"
  schemaName="电池行业周刊 — 2026年第38周"
  schemaDescription={description}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  lang="zh"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
      <a href="/zh/news" class="text-label-uppercase text-xs text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 inline-block">&larr; 返回资讯</a>
      <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbs} />
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-xs block mb-4">每周期刊</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-primary mb-4">电池行业周刊 — 第38周</h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-caption text-muted mb-6">
        <span>9月14日 – 9月20日, 2026</span>
        <span>{readingTime} 分钟阅读</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light">
        本周电池资讯：合同收入是加州BESS融资的关键，esVolta首席执行官解释，伊比利亚BESS市场需要更多灵活性、更清晰的框架和更快的审批，'一个真正困难的问题'：Gridmatic首席商务官谈BESS收入预测挑战，人工智能和负荷共址的作用。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Story 1 -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">合同收入是加州BESS融资的关键，esVolta首席执行官解释</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">Energy-Storage.news Premium在加利福尼亚州花园市举行的2026年美国电池资产管理峰会上采访了开发商esVolta首席执行官Randolph Mann。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 2 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">伊比利亚BESS市场需要更多灵活性、更清晰的框架和更快的审批</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">在上周于西班牙巴塞罗那举行的Battery & Energy Tech Expo上，小组讨论者强调了企业在加快BESS部署方面面临的一些挑战。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 3 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">'一个真正困难的问题'：Gridmatic首席商务官谈BESS收入预测挑战、人工智能和负荷共址的作用</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">Energy-Storage.news Premium在加利福尼亚州花园市举行的2026年美国电池资产管理峰会上采访了优化公司Gridmatic首席商务官David Miller。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 4 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">Jupiter Power完成14亿美元融资，支持美国10个BESS项目共计3.8GWh</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">美国电池储能系统（BESS）开发商运营商Jupiter Power已完成14亿美元融资，支持美国10个BESS项目共计3,600MWh容量。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 5 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">BESS行业热议：Energy Storage Summit Germany要点汇总</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">汇总本周Energy Storage Summit Germany的一些重要要点，包括FCA、惯性、容量市场（CM）、欧盟对中国的限制以及一家重要企业的未来发展。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 6 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">什么使德国BESS项目具有融资可行性？贷方和业主在Energy Storage Summit Germany上发表意见</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">BESS项目业主、贷方和优化公司今天在柏林启动了Energy Storage Summit Germany 2026，讨论如何开发具有融资可行性的项目。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 7 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">具有竞争力的TCO、详细规格和强大的本地业务是BESS供应商在德国成功的关键，RWE表示</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">我们在Energy Storage Summit Germany 2026之前听取了RWE Renewables Europe & Australia的BESS负责人介绍该国电网级储能领域的主要趋势、挑战和机遇。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 8 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">船舶</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">American Battery Technology (ABAT)实现盈利，但面临新的出口威胁</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">American Battery Technology Company第二季度实现盈利，受锂离子电池回收业务推动，但面临出口监管不确定性。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 9 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">维多利亚州SEC参与澳大利亚1.86GWh电池储能系统，与Aware Super和Birdwood合作</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">维多利亚州SEC投资高达4300万澳元，与Aware Super合作获取位于Wodonga附近的400MW Baranduda电池系统股份。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 10 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">摩洛哥首个大型LFP电池储能系统准备就绪</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">OCP Green Energy已在摩洛哥本盖里尔完成25MW/125MWh电池储能系统（BESS）的安装。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Analysis -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-6">本周聚焦</h2>
      <div class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline p-6">
        <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">
          本周新闻中值得追踪的三大主题：
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-body-sm text-muted">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">规模化已成新常态。</strong> 电池部署在各细分领域持续增长——电动汽车、电网储能和船舶——使电池成为核心技术基础设施，而非小众市场。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">化学体系多元化加速。</strong> LFP、固态、钠离子和硅负极化学体系均在同步推进，各自针对不同的成本和性能权衡。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">法规正在重塑供应链。</strong> 欧盟电池护照要求和国内制造激励政策迫使企业重新思考采购、文档和合规时间线。
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What to Watch -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-6">下周关注</h2>
      <div class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline p-6">
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
          <li>固态电池商业化时间线的持续更新</li>
          <li>欧盟委员会关于EU电池法规实施指南</li>
          <li>新电网级BESS项目投运和容量里程碑报告</li>
          <li>影响电池经济性的锂和关键矿石价格趋势</li>
          <li>钠离子和下一代化学体系产能扩张公告</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-4">来源</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/contracted-revenue-key-to-california-bess-financing-as-merchant-market-weakens-esvolta-ceo-explains/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">合同收入是加州BESS融资的关键 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/iberian-bess-market-needs-more-flexibility-clearer-frameworks-and-faster-permitting/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">伊比利亚BESS市场需要更多灵活性 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/a-really-hard-problem-gridmatic-cco-on-the-challenges-of-bess-revenue-forecasting-the-role-of-ai-and-load-co-location/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">'一个真正困难的问题'：Gridmatic谈BESS收入预测挑战 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/jupiter-power-closes-us1-4-billion-financing-for-10-us-bess-projects-totalling-3-8gwh/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jupiter Power完成14亿美元融资 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/bess-industry-buzz-energy-storage-summit-germany-takeaways/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BESS行业热议：Energy Storage Summit Germany要点 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/what-makes-a-german-bess-project-bankable-lenders-owners-weigh-in-at-energy-storage-summit-germany/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">什么使德国BESS项目具有融资可行性 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/competitive-tco-detailed-specs-strong-local-presence-key-bess-supplier-success-germany-rwe-says/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">具有竞争力的TCO是BESS供应商在德国成功的关键 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/victorias-sec-takes-stake-in-1-86gwh-battery-storage-system-in-australia-alongside-aware-super-and-birdwood/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">维多利亚州SEC参与1.86GWh电池储能系统 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/moroccos-first-large-scale-lfp-battery-storage-system-prepares-for-action/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">摩洛哥首个大型LFP电池储能系统准备就绪 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <section class="mb-16 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline p-6">
        <h3 class="text-title-lg text-primary mb-3">免责声明</h3>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-muted">
          本文总结了公开可用的新闻和分析。BatteryCalculators.com不保证第三方信息的准确性。在做出工程或采购决策前，请务必通过主要来源核实事实。本内容仅供参考，不构成专业工程建议。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</Layout>
